-- Baseline: the production schema as of 2026-11-09, squashed into one file
-- (generated by drizzle-kit from lib/db/schema.ts, then hand-edited). The 53
-- migrations in drizzle-legacy/ are history only: production evolved partly
-- outside them, so replaying them does not give this schema. Fresh installs
-- run this file through the migrator; production is adopted with
-- `opsdeck migrate --adopt` (recorded, not run). tests/fixtures/
-- prod-schema-20261109.sql is the reference it must reproduce exactly.
-- Hand edits, all to match production:
--   - column order follows the production tables (columns added later by
--     ALTER TABLE come last);
--   - NOT NULL constraints keep the names they got under earlier table or
--     column names (tasks → runs, projects → environments, project_access →
--     environment_access, deploy_apps → app_components, position → rank);
--   - "rank" columns are C-collated (fractional-indexing byte order);
--   - the default labels.
